[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8887.99, "timestamp": "02:28:07", "text": "头部的一个名字是狗。 只瞄准"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8902.63, "timestamp": "02:28:22", "text": "顺便一提，你的角色将来会造成巨额伤害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8905.67, "timestamp": "02:28:25", "text": "将来，而不是现在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8910.07, "timestamp": "02:28:30", "text": "不，他们会给你很少的积分，让你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8926.15, "timestamp": "02:28:46", "text": "是否切题？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8928.15, "timestamp": "02:28:48", "text": "我们四个人都在吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8930.15, "timestamp": "02:28:50", "text": "真相究竟在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8937.349, "timestamp": "02:28:57", "text": "哦，死了一个人。"}]